s recorded on the system accessed.","status":"not_a_finding","check_content_ref":{"name":"oval:mil.disa.stig.windows2022:def:254311","href":"U_MS_Windows_Server_2022_V2R8_STIG_SCAP_1-4_Benchmark-enhancedV18-oval.xml"},"rule_id_src":"SV-254311r991581_rule","ccis":["CCI-000172"],"third_party_tools":"","check_content":"Security Option \"Audit: Force audit policy subcategory settings (Windows Vista or later) to override audit policy category settings\" must be set to \"Enabled\" (WN22-SO-000050) for the detailed auditing subcategories to be effective. \n\nUse the \"AuditPol\" tool to review the current Audit Policy configuration:\n\nOpen \"PowerShell\" or a \"Command Prompt\" with elevated privileges (\"Run as administrator\").\n\nEnter \"AuditPol /get /category:*\"\n\nCompare the \"AuditPol\" settings with the following:\n\nIf the system does not audit the following, this is a finding.\n\nLogon/Logoff &gt;&gt; Logoff - Success","documentable":"false","fix_text":"Configure the policy value for Computer Configuration &gt;&gt; Windows Settings &gt;&gt; Security Settings &gt;&gt; Advanced Audit Policy Configuration &gt;&gt; System Audit Policies &gt;&gt; Logon/Logoff &gt;&gt; Audit Logoff with \"Success\" selected."},{"severity":"medium","group_id":"V-254312","mitigation_control":"","group_id_src":"V-254312","ia_controls":"","responsibility":"","stig_uuid":"3DC2EBF0-6BF9-1014-A6FF-AFCBE32ABA75","classification":"Unclassified","mitigations":"","comments":null,"legacy_ids":[],"group_tree":{"title":"SRG-OS-000032-GPOS-00013","id":"V-254312"},"rule_version":"WN22-AU-000190","weight":"10.0","reference_identifier":"5485","finding_details":"Tool: cpe:/a:niwc:scc:5.14.1\nTime         : 2026-09-05T13:12:25\nResult: passRule Result             : Pass\nCriteria                : true (All child tests must be true. (AND))\nCriteria                :   true (One or more child tests must be true. (OR))\nTest                    :     false ('Audit Logon' is set to 'Success')\nTest         