above, using this IS does not constitute consent to PM, LE or CI investigative searching or monitoring of the content of privileged communications, or work product, related to personal representation or services by attorneys, psychotherapists, or clergy, and their assistants. Such communications and work product are private and confidential. See User Agreement for details.'\n                        : windows_view equals '64_bit'\n\n---\n\nTest ID                 : oval:navy.navwar.niwcatlantic.scc.windows:tst:25445703 (registry_test)\nResult                  : true\nTest Title              : The required legal notice must be configured to display before console logon - Message Content 3\nCheck Existence         : One or more collected items must exist.\nCheck                   : One and only one item may match the given state(s).\n\nObject ID               : oval:navy.navwar.niwcatlantic.scc.windows:obj:25445701 (registry_object)\nObject Comment          : Legal notice text\nObject Requirement      :  check =  'hive' must be equal to 'HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE'\nObject Requirement      :  check =  'key' must be equal to 'SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Policies\\System'\nObject Requirement      :  check =  'name' must be equal to 'LegalNoticeText'\n\nState ID                : oval:navy.navwar.niwcatlantic.scc.windows:ste:25445703 (registry_state)\nState Comment           : Warning Banner - -The USG routinely intercepts and monitors communications on this IS for purposes including, but not limited to, penetration testing, COMSEC monitoring, network operations and defense, personnel misconduct (PM), law enforcement (LE), and counterintelligence (CI) investigations.\nState Requirement       : check_existence = 'at_least_one_exists',  check = all 'value' must match the pattern '-The USG routinely intercepts and monitors communications on this IS for purposes including, but not limited to, penetration testing, COMSEC monitoring, network operations and defense, per