  : One or more collected items must exist.\nCheck                   : All collected items must match the given state(s).\n\nObject ID               : oval:mil.disa.stig.win:obj:25446400 (registry_object)\nObject Comment          : Check the registry value at HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\LanManServer\\Parameters\\EnableSecuritySignature\nObject Requirement      :  check =  'hive' must be equal to 'HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE'\nObject Requirement      :  check =  'key' must be equal to 'SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\LanManServer\\Parameters'\nObject Requirement      :  check =  'name' must be equal to 'EnableSecuritySignature'\n\nState ID                : oval:mil.disa.stig.win:ste:20000001 (registry_state)\nState Comment           : \nState Requirement       : check_existence = 'at_least_one_exists',  check = all 'type' must be equal to 'reg_dword'\nState Requirement       : check_existence = 'at_least_one_exists',  check = all 'value' must be equal to '1'\n\nCollected Item/State Result : true\n                        : hive equals 'HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE'\n                        : key equals 'SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\LanManServer\\Parameters'\n                        : name equals 'EnableSecuritySignature'\n                        : last_write_time equals '134330994440000000'\n                        : type equals 'reg_dword'\n                        : value equals '1'\n                        : windows_view equals '64_bit'\n","ccis":["CCI-002418","CCI-002421"],"check_content_ref":{"name":"oval:mil.disa.stig.windows2022:def:254464","href":"U_MS_Windows_Server_2022_V2R8_STIG_SCAP_1-4_Benchmark-enhancedV18-oval.xml"},"status":"not_a_finding","rule_id_src":"SV-254464r958908_rule","rule_id":"SV-254464r958908","security_override_guidance":"","rule_title":"Windows Server 2022 setting Microsoft network server: Digitally sign communications (if client agrees) must be configured to Enabled.","potential_impacts":"","group_title":"SRG-OS-000423-GPOS-00187","uuid":"3E24C4BA-6BF9-1014-9096-EBB6E6008DF2"},{"reference_identifier":"5485","rule_version":"WN22-SO-000210","weight":"10.0","mitigations":"","legacy_ids":[],"comments":null,"group_tree":{"title":"SRG-OS-000480-GPOS-00227","id":"V-254465"},"classification":"Unclassified","mitigation_control":"","ia_controls":"","group_id_src":"V-254465","responsibility":"","stig_uuid":"3DC2EBF0-6BF9-1014-A6FF-AFCBE32ABA75","severity":"high","group_id":"V-254465","check_content":"Verify the effective setting in Local Group Policy Editor.\n\nRun \"gpedit.msc\".\n\nNavigate to Local Computer Policy &gt;&gt; Computer Configuration &gt;&gt; Windows Settings &gt;&gt; Security Settings &gt;&gt; Local Policies &gt;&gt; Security Options.\n\nIf the value for \"Network access: Allow anonymous SID/Name translation\" is not set to \"Disabled\", this is a finding.","third_party_tools":"","fix_text":"Configure the policy value for Computer Configuration &gt;&gt; Windows Settings &gt;&gt; Security Settings &gt;&gt; Local Policies &gt;&gt; Security Options &gt;&gt; Network access: Allow anonymous SID/Name translation to \"Disabled\".","documentable":"false","uuid":"3E24CBDC-6BF9-1014-83FF-9E3452447772","group_title":"SRG-OS-000480-GPOS-00227","potential_impacts":"","rule_title":"Windows Server 2022 must not allow anonymous SID/Name translation.","security_override_guidance":"","rule_id":"SV-254465r991589","check_content_ref":{"href":"U_MS_Windows_Server_2022_V2R8_STIG_SCAP_1-4_Benchmark-enhancedV18-oval2.xml","name":"oval:navy.navwar.niwcatlantic.scc.windows:def:254465"},"status":"not_a_finding","rule_id_src":"SV-254465r991589_rule","ccis":["CCI-000366"],"finding_details":"Tool: cpe:/a:niwc:scc:5.14.1\nTime         : 2026-09-05T13:12:25\nResult: passRule Result             : Pass\nCriteria                : true (All child tests must be true. (AND))\nTest                    :   true (Network access: Allow anonymous SID/Name translation is set to 'Disabled')\n\n---\n\nTest ID                 : oval:navy.navwar.niwcatlantic.scc.windows:tst:25446501 (passwordpolicy_test)\nResult                  : true\nTest Title              : Network access: Allow anonymous SID/Name translation is set to 'Disabled'\nCheck Existence         : One or more collected items must exist.\nCheck                   : All collected items must match the given state(s).\n\nObject ID               : oval:navy.navwar.niwcatlantic.scc.windows:obj:25446501 (passwordpolicy_object)\nObject Comment          : Retrieves a passwordpolicy_object.\nObject Requirement      : Collect any available items.\n\nState ID                : oval:navy.navwar.niwcatlantic.scc.windows:ste:25446501 (passwordpolicy_state)\nState Comment           : This passwordpolicy_state represents a password policy that has a anonymous_name_lookup equal to '0'.\nState Requirement       : check_existence = 'at_least_one_exists',  check = all 'anonymous_name_lookup' must be equal to '0'\n\nCollected Item/State Result : true\n                        : max_passwd_age equals '5184000'\n                        : min_passwd_age equals '86400'\n                        : min_passwd_len equals '14'\n                        : password_hist_len equals '24'\n                        : password_complexity equals '1'\n                        : reversible_encryption equals '0'\n                        : anonymous_name_lookup equals '0'\n","false_positives":"","discussion":"Allowing anonymous SID/Name translation can provide sensitive information for accessing a system. Only authorized users must be able to perform such translations."},{"documentable":"false","fix_text":"Configure the policy value for Computer Configuration &gt;&gt; Windows Settings &gt;&gt; Security Settings &gt;&gt; Local Policies &gt;&gt; Security Options &gt;&gt; Network access: Do not allow anonymous enumeration of SAM accounts to \"Enabled\".","check_content":"If the following registry value does not exist or is not configured as specified, this is a finding:\n\nRegistry Hive: HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE \nRegistry Path: \\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\Lsa\\\n\nValue Name: RestrictAnonymousSAM\n\nValue Type: REG_DWORD\nValue: 0x00000001 (1)","third_party_tools":"","check_content_ref":{"name":"oval:mil.disa.stig.windows2022:def:254466","href":"U_MS_Windows_Server_2022_V2R8_STIG_SCAP_1-4_Benchmark-enhancedV18-oval.xml"},"status":"not_a_finding","rule_id_src":"SV-254466r991589_rule","ccis":["CCI-000366"],"false_positives":"","finding_details":"Tool: cpe:/a:niwc:scc:5.14.1\nTime         : 2026-09-05T13:12:25\nResult: passRule Result             : Pass\nCriteria                : true (All child tests must be true. (AND))\nCriteria                :   true (All child tests must be true. (AND))\nTest                    :     true ('Network access: Do not allow anonymous enumeration of SAM accounts' is set to 'Enabled')\n\n---\n\nTest ID                 : oval:mil.disa.stig.win:tst:25345300 (registry_test)\nResult                  : true\nTest Title              : 'Network access: Do not allow anonymous enumeration of SAM accounts' is set to 'Enabled'\nCheck Existence         : One or more collected items must exist.\nCheck                   : All collected items must match the given state(s).\n\nObject ID               : oval:mil.disa.stig.win:obj:25345300 (registry_object)\nObject Comment          : Check for HKLM\\System\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\Lsa\\RestrictAnonymousSAM\nObject Requirement      :  check =  'hive' must be equal to 'HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE'\nObject Requirement      :  check =  'key' must be equal to 'System\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\Lsa'\nObject Requirement      :  check =  'name' must be equal (case insensitive) to 'RestrictAnonymousSAM'\n\nState ID                : oval:mil.disa.stig.win:ste:20000001 (registry_state)\nState Comment           : \nState Requirement       : check_existence = 'at_least_one_exists',  check = all 'type' must be equal to 'reg_dword'\nState Requirement       : check_existence = 'at_least_one_exists',  check = all 'value' must be equal to '1'\n\nCollected Item/State Result : true\n                        : hive equals 'HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE'\n                        : key equals 'System\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\Lsa'\n                        : name equals 'RestrictAnonymousSAM'\n                        : last_write_time equals '134330994430000000'\n                        : type equals 'reg_dword'\n                        : value equals '1'\n                        : windows_view equals '64_bit'\n","discussion":"Anonymous enumeration of SAM accounts allows anonymous logon users (null session connections) to list all accounts names, thus providing a list of potential points to attack the system.","group_title":"SRG-OS-000480-GPOS-00227","uuid":"3E24D248-6BF9-1014-8BB3-A08A37BD3B47","security_override_guidance":"","rule_title":"Windows Server 2022 must not allow anonymous enumeration of Security Account Manager (SAM) accounts.","potential_impacts":"","rule_id":"SV-254466r991589","mitigations":"","group_tree":{"title":"SRG-OS-000480-GPOS-00227","id":"V-254466"},"legacy_ids":[],"comments":null,"classification":"Unclassified","reference_identifier":"5485","weight":"10.0","rule_version":"WN22-SO-000220","group_id_src":"V-254466","ia_controls":"","mitigation_control":"","stig_uuid":"3DC2EBF0-6BF9-1014-A6FF-AFCBE32ABA75","responsibility":"","severity":"high","group_id":"V-254466"},{"group_title":"SRG-OS-000138-GPOS-00069","uuid":"3E24D8D5-6BF9-1014-913D-AFF33FF512F9","rule_id":"SV-254467r1137695","security_override_guidance":"","rule_title":"Windows Server 2022 must not allow anonymous enumeration of shares.","potential_impacts":"","ccis":["CCI-001090"],"check_content_ref":{"name":"oval:mil.disa.stig.windows2022:def:254467","href":"U_MS_Windows_Server_2022_V2R8_STIG_SCAP_1-4_Benchmark-enhancedV18-oval.xml"},"status":"not_a_finding","rule_id_src":"SV-254467r1137695_rule","discussion":"Allowing anonymous logon users (null session connections) to list al